{"r":"fwj","lane":{"p":2455,"e":[{"h":"فَاجَ","t":["[aor. ",[2,"يَفُوجُ"],",] said of musk, ",[1,"i. q."],[2,"فَاحَ"]," [i. e. ",[1,"It diffused,"]," or ",[1,"exhaled, its odour"],"]. (O, K.) ― -b2- And, said of the day, (tropical:) ",[1,"It became cool."]," (O, K, TA.) And one says, ",[2,"فَاجَتِ الشَّمْسُ عِنْدَ بَرْدِ النَّهَارِ"]," (assumed tropical:) [",[1,"The sun became moderated at the cool time of the day"],"]. (O.)"],"f":"1"},{"h":"لَسْتُ بِرَائِحٍ حَتَّى أُفَوِّجَ","t":["means [",[1,"I am not going in the evening"],"] ",[1,"until I refresh myself by the coolness of the air."]," (K: there expl. by the words ",[2,"أَىْ"],[2,"أُبَرِّدَ عَنْ نَفْسِى"]," [in which, for ",[2,"أُبَرِّدَ"],", I read ",[2,"أُبْرِدَ"],"]: in some copies [erroneously] ",[2,"عَلَى نفسى"],".)"],"f":"2"},{"h":"افاج","t":["(K,) inf. n. ",[2,"إِفَاجَةٌ"],", (S,) ",[1,"He hastened,"]," or ",[1,"went quickly;"]," (S, K, and O and Msb in art. ",[2,"فيج"],":) and ",[1,"he ran."]," (S, K.) ― -b2- And ",[2,"افاج القَوْمُ"],[2,"فِى الأَرْضِ"],[1,"The people,"]," or ",[1,"party, went away, and spread,"]," or ",[1,"dispersed themselves, in the land."]," (L in art. ",[2,"فيج"],".) ― -b3- And ",[2,"افاج فِى عَدْوِهِ"],[1,"He was slow in his running."]," (L in art. ",[2,"فيج"],".) [Thus ",[2,"افاج"]," has two contr. significations.] -A2- Also ",[1,"He sent the camels to the watering-trough,"]," or ",[1,"tank, drove by drove."]," (O, * K.)"],"f":"4"},{"h":"اُسْتُفِيجَ فُلَانٌ","t":[[1,"Such a one was desired,"]," or ",[1,"incited, to be"]," [",[1,"quick,"]," or] ",[1,"brisk,"]," or ",[1,"prompt;"]," syn. ",[2,"اُسْتُخِفَّ"],". (K, and O in art. ",[2,"فيج"],".)"],"f":"10"},{"h":"فَوْجٌ","t":[[1,"A company, congregated body, party,"]," or ",[1,"group, of men;"]," (S, A, O, L, Msb, K; *) as also ↓ ",[2,"فَائِجٌ"],", (L,) and ↓ ",[2,"فَائِجَةٌ"],", (K,) and ↓ ",[2,"فَيْجٌ"],", (O, K, and Msb in art. ",[2,"فيج"],", q. v.,) which last is said by Az to be originally ",[2,"فَيِّجٌ"],", from ",[2,"فَاجَ"],", 